   "score": 0.9978,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "text": "前几天我在遗珑埠排练时，突然下起了好大一阵雨。雨点接连不断地砸",
   "cx": 1852,
   "cy": 444,
   "bbox": [
    1317,
    425,
    2388,
    464
   ],
   "w": 1071,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9996,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "text": "新",
   "cx": 1220,
   "cy": 474,
   "bbox": [
    1197,
    452,
    1243,
    496
   ],
   "w": 46,
   "h": 44,
   "score": 1.0,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "text": "祝他成功。",
   "cx": 431,
   "cy": 502,
   "bbox": [
    336,
    478,
    526,
    527
   ],
   "w": 190,
   "h": 49,
   "score": 0.9999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "text": "在屋檐、石板和灯笼上，听着还挺像一段即兴的鼓点。我抱着琴，跟着",
   "cx": 1843,
   "cy": 488,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    469,
    2367,
    507
   ],
   "w": 1049,
   "h": 38,
   "score": 0.9989,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "text": "这来自天上的节奏弹奏了起来，没想到越弹越起劲，手指都快冒烟了！",
   "cx": 1843,
   "cy": 530,
   "bbox": [
    1316,
    509,
    2370,
    552
   ],
   "w": 1054,
   "h": 43,
   "score": 0.9894,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "text": "欧洛伦",
   "cx": 428,
   "cy": 560,
   "bbox": [
    378,
    540,
    478,
    581
   ],
   "w": 100,
   "h": 41,
   "score": 0.9995,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "text": "这事给了我一个启发。既然风声、雨声能成为音乐，那么大雪与冰雹岂",
   "cx": 1847,
   "cy": 574,
   "bbox": [
    1317,
    555,
    2378,
    594
   ],
   "w": 1061,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "text": "新",
   "cx": 1220,
   "cy": 630,
   "bbox": [
    1196,
    609,
    1245,
    651
   ],
   "w": 49,
   "h": 42,
   "score": 1.0,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "text": "不是也能作为灵感来源？我的摇滚之火，会在冰天雪地中燃烧出怎样",
   "cx": 1842,
   "cy": 618,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    599,
    2366,
    637
   ],
   "w": 1048,
   "h": 38,
   "score": 0.9892,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "text": "舞台·",
   "cx": 385,
   "cy": 660,
   "bbox": [
    334,
    635,
    436,
    686
   ],
   "w": 102,
   "h": 51,
   "score": 0.9729,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "text": "精彩的旋律呢？想想就迫不及待！",
   "cx": 1574,
   "cy": 660,
   "bbox": [
    1316,
    641,
    1833,
    680
   ],
   "w": 517,
   "h": 39,
   "score": 0.9873,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "text": "芙宁娜",
   "cx": 423,
   "cy": 715,
   "bbox": [
    371,
    695,
    476,
    735
   ],
   "w": 105,
   "h": 40,
   "score": 0.9996,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "text": "…尽管真的很想这么冲动一回，但去至冬和去沉玉谷可不一样，还得从",
   "cx": 1852,
   "cy": 703,
   "bbox": [
    1318,
    685,
    2387,
    722
   ],
   "w": 1069,
   "h": 37,
   "score": 0.9975,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "text": "长计议。",
   "cx": 1380,
   "cy": 746,
   "bbox": [
    1314,
    722,
    1446,
    770
   ],
   "w": 132,
   "h": 48,
   "score": 0.9999,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "text": "新",
   "cx": 1221,
   "cy": 788,
   "bbox": [
    1197,
    766,
    1245,
    810
   ],
   "w": 48,
   "h": 44,
   "score": 1.0,
   "kind": "content"
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "text": "总之，给你带了点当地特产，往后也为我加油吧！",
   "cx": 1685,
   "cy": 790,
   "bbox": [
    1316,
    768,
